## The aesthetics of un-clarity

Diffusion filters, smeared focus, fog: each one asks the viewer to complete the image, and a viewer who completes an image has agreed to be complicit in it.

## Against the sharp

High resolution flattened a century of mystery. The blur is how contemporary cinema smuggles it back in.
